      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你真了不起。虽然你一直都很厉害，\n但今天又更上一层楼……\n风果然能带给你力量吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "977787682fdf5278a2de40acdbeacee4fa66298eba612b6a2fc877d7b8ff69c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
